# Phase 83.01 — pageList Schema Fix

> **Status:** Ready to execute
> **Urgency:** P1. Production BigSeller data has been stale since 2026-04-22 (27 days).
> **Estimated effort:** 30 LOC, 1 file change in code + tests, ~45 min including verify.

## Git Workflow

**Branch:** `fix/bigseller-pagelist-schema-refresh-83-01`
**Base:** `main` (after pulling current main — confirm last 81 phase merge `e040b953` is present)
**Checkpoints:**
1. After code change: `npm run type-check` + `npm run lint`
2. After tests: `npm run test -- bigseller`
3. After manual sync (dev env): observe `bigsellerOrders` row count increases for May 8 – May 19 range
4. Build: `npm run build`
5. Triple-review gate per CLAUDE.md (this is a vendor-API contract change — exactly the kind triple-review catches)

## Implementation Waves

### Wave 1: Backend [SEQUENTIAL, single file]

| Agent | Task | Files |
|---|---|---|
| convex-backend | Update `buildPageListBody()` to match HAR-verified schema | `convex/integrations/bigseller/helpers.ts` |
| tdd-test-architect | Update helper unit tests to assert presence of every required field | `convex/integrations/bigseller/__tests__/helpers.test.ts` |

**Exact change to `buildPageListBody()`:**

```ts
export function buildPageListBody(
  startDate: string,
  endDate: string,
  pageNo: number,
  shopIds: number[] = BIGSELLER_FROLLIE_SHOP_IDS,
  platformTemplate: "common" | "shopee" | "tiktok" = "common",
): Record<string, unknown> {
  // Platform-specific endpoints use empty-string for groupType + currency;
  // the generic /pageList.json common endpoint uses int 0 / "" respectively.
  // Verified against HAR captured 2026-05-19 from www.bigseller.com.
  const isPlatformSpecific = platformTemplate === "shopee" || platformTemplate === "tiktok";

  return {
    pageNo,
    pageSize: BIGSELLER_PAGE_SIZE,
    searchType: "order",
    platformTemplate,
    startTime: startDate,
    endTime: endDate,
    timeType: "orderCreatedTime",
    // NEW (2026-05-19): currency is now sourced from totalCurrency; this field
    // is empty for both common + platform endpoints in the working HAR.
    currency: "",
    // CHANGED (2026-05-19): BigSeller dropped "canceled" + "new" from accepted
    // orderState values. Sending them produces code:-1 with no other indication.
    orderState: ["completed", "shipped", "other"],
    queryType: "sku",
    orderType: "orderNo",
    orderBy: "",
    desc: false,
    inquireType: 0,
    platforms: [],
    shopIds,
    warehouseIds: [],
    // Platform-specific endpoints want "" (empty string); common still accepts null.
    // Use "" everywhere to match working HAR most exactly.
    searchContent: isPlatformSpecific ? "" : null,
    adjustmentUpdateTimeStartTime: null,
    adjustmentUpdateTimeEndTime: null,
    lableIds: null,
    hasLable: "",
    sampleOrder: null,
    dimension: "",
    evalationOrder: "",
    categoryList: "",

    // ── NEW REQUIRED FIELDS (2026-05-19) ─────────────────────────────────
    // Omitting any of these produces code:-1 "Failed, please try again later".
    // Source: HAR pageList request body, 2026-05-19.

    /** Settlement filter. `1` = settled orders only. Verified working value. */
    settleStatus: 1,
    /** Transaction status filter. Empty = all. */
    transactionStatus: "",
    /** Fulfilled-by-Shopee filter. Empty = exclude FBS. */
    fbsOrder: "",
    /** Group dimension. int 0 on common; empty string on shopee/tiktok. */
    groupType: isPlatformSpecific ? "" : 0,
    /** Currency for response totals. ISO code, e.g. "IDR". */
    totalCurrency: "IDR",
    /** Per-row order-status filter. Empty = all. Only sent on platform endpoints. */
    ...(isPlatformSpecific ? { orderStatus: [] } : {}),
  };
}
```

**Test updates (`helpers.test.ts`):**

Add a new test block that pins every required field for each `platformTemplate`:

```ts
describe("buildPageListBody — 2026-05-19 schema", () => {
  const REQUIRED_FIELDS_COMMON = [
    "pageNo", "pageSize", "searchType", "platformTemplate", "startTime", "endTime",
    "timeType", "currency", "orderState", "queryType", "orderType", "orderBy", "desc",
    "inquireType", "platforms", "shopIds", "warehouseIds", "searchContent",
    "adjustmentUpdateTimeStartTime", "adjustmentUpdateTimeEndTime", "lableIds", "hasLable",
    "sampleOrder", "dimension", "evalationOrder", "categoryList",
    "settleStatus", "transactionStatus", "fbsOrder", "groupType", "totalCurrency",
  ];

  it("common body contains every required field, none of the banned orderState values", () => {
    const body = buildPageListBody("2026-04-19", "2026-05-19", 1);
    for (const field of REQUIRED_FIELDS_COMMON) expect(body).toHaveProperty(field);
    expect(body.orderState).toEqual(["completed", "shipped", "other"]);
    expect(body.totalCurrency).toBe("IDR");
    expect(body.groupType).toBe(0);
  });

  it("shopee body adds orderStatus and uses empty-string groupType", () => {
    const body = buildPageListBody("2026-04-19", "2026-05-19", 1, [5090946], "shopee");
    for (const field of REQUIRED_FIELDS_COMMON) expect(body).toHaveProperty(field);
    expect(body).toHaveProperty("orderStatus");
    expect(body.orderStatus).toEqual([]);
    expect(body.groupType).toBe("");
    expect(body.searchContent).toBe("");
  });

  it("tiktok body has identical shape to shopee with platformTemplate switched", () => {
    const shopee = buildPageListBody("2026-04-19", "2026-05-19", 1, [5092855], "shopee");
    const tiktok = buildPageListBody("2026-04-19", "2026-05-19", 1, [5092855], "tiktok");
    delete (shopee as any).platformTemplate;
    delete (tiktok as any).platformTemplate;
    expect(tiktok).toEqual(shopee);
  });

  it("orderState never contains canceled or new", () => {
    const body = buildPageListBody("2026-04-19", "2026-05-19", 1);
    expect(body.orderState).not.toContain("canceled");
    expect(body.orderState).not.toContain("new");
  });
});
```

