## Out of scope (deferred to 83.02)

- Parallelizing platform fetch (Shopee + TikTok in parallel)
- Parallelizing pages 2..N within a platform (after page 1 reveals totalPage)
- Adaptive polling (15s → 30s → 60s backoff instead of fixed 60s × 8)
- N+1 query elimination in revenue linking (`getRevenueById` per row → `getRevenueByIds` batch)
- Capturing the refreshed `muctoken` from response headers to auto-extend the 20-day TTL
- Raising `pageSize` from 50 → 100 to halve page-count
